# Zigtelic Google Review Auto-Reply

Node.js/Express web app for Google Business Profile review management.

## Render deployment

This project is configured for Render. **Do not use `mix phx.digest`**; that command is for Elixir/Phoenix and caused the previous build failure.

Render settings:
- Runtime: Node
- Build Command: `npm install`
- Start Command: `npm start`
- Health Check: `/health`
- Node: 20+

If using the included `render.yaml`, create a Blueprint from the repository and Render will use these settings.

## Environment variables on Render

Set:
- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` = your Google OAuth Client ID
- `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` = your Google OAuth Client Secret (keep private)
- `GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI` = `https://YOUR-RENDER-DOMAIN.onrender.com/oauth2callback`
- `AI_API_KEY` = optional AI key

The Google OAuth Client ID supplied for this project is:
