In Google Cloud Console, add the exact Render callback URL to the OAuth client's **Authorized redirect URIs**.

## Local

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Open `http://localhost:3000`.

## Google permissions

The app requests the `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/business.manage` OAuth scope. Google Business Profile API access/approval and an eligible Google Business Profile account are required. Never put the Client Secret in frontend code or GitHub.

## Features
- Google OAuth login
- Business account/location discovery API
- Review listing
- AI/template reply generation
- Human confirmation before publishing
- Google Business Profile review reply endpoint
